  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Holistic due diligence framework for energy transition minerals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to apply learnings from 3T (Tin, Tantalum and Tungsten) and gold value chains to promote transparency along the supply chain of battery materials and support the artisanal and small-scale mining (ASM) sector in Southern Democratic Republic of Congo, to ensure positive returns for local communities, promote inclusive forms of engagement and mitigate environmental risk.The project focuses on enabling ASM operators&apos; access to legitimate finance and markets, leveraging synergies between supply chain due diligence and the banking sector&#x2019;s own due diligence requirements.</narrative>
  </description>
